quiet.md #10: offscreen captures outside tests

Upstream can render a window's scene into an offscreen texture and read it
back (Window::render_to_image), but only with `test-support`. Build it always
on macOS, and add Window::render_offscreen (run next-frame callbacks, draw,
render without presenting) and Window::needs_draw. The devtools script driver
takes its screenshots this way, so they work while the window is occluded or
the screen is locked.

